  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Spirit Manipulation — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned how to expand your domain. A tree of souls surrounded by four seated Buddhas at the cardinal points emerges behind you, as your barrier starts opening. The area targeted by this feature counts as difficult terrain for all creatures. You can use any of your cursed spirits without any cost. Cursed spirits within your domain must make a Charisma saving throw at the beginning of their turns or be instantly absorbed by you.</p>",
